.FIRE WEATHER...
Issued at 502 AM PDT Wed Sep 30 2026

A high pressure system will move in from the west and compress the
marine layer to approximately 500 feet. Hot and dry conditions
will prevail through late week and weekend. Expect poor overnight
humidity recoveries, with overnight relative humidities as low as
20-30% above the marine layer.

